*###VERIFY TO DO
*###   NEED A SEVERELY DAMAGED DATASET TO SHOW THAT VERIFY WORKS
*###   MAYBE A VERIFY0 TO TURN OFF VERCOUNT
*###   WHY DON'T I VERIFY THE AIX'S ?
*
*###   VALIDATE THE STCKS BY FINDING 01/01/2021 00:00+1USEC
*###      PFX AND CTR STCKS MUST BE BIGGER
*###      D94BF424B2988000 19/ 2/2021 11:44:29.125000 UTC
*###      =3822723869.125000
*###      -48DAYS -11:44:29.125000=  -4147200 -42269.125 = -4189469.125
*###      =3818534400=X'E39A3600'*1000000=X'D90EFD2798000'
*###      D90EFD2798001000 (+1 USEC)
*
*   ALSO DOC IN D&L, NEW SECTION DEFINING CTR, ALSO SAY INIT IN ZREPRO
*   CTRAVGRL.....FIXED AND INDEX=RECSIZE, BUT CALC ANYWAY
*                VARIABLE=AVG EXCLUDING SPX, INCLUDING RLF
*                FOR VAR RRDS, EXCLUDING ENPTIES
*   CTRAVSPAC....TOTAL FREESPACE IN DATA/INDEX BLOCKS
*   CTRHALCRBA...DATA...BLOCKRBA+1 OF HIGHEST DATA BLOCK WITH DATA
*                INDEX..BLOCKRBA+1 OF HIGHEST L0 BLOCK WITH INDEX
*                IF ALL HAVE DATA/INDEX, HALCRBA=ENDRBA
*                IF EMPTY, HALCRBA=0
*                BECAUSE OF EMBEDDED SEGMENTS AND SPACEMAPS ANY CALCS
*                ARE MEANINGLESS
*   CTRHLRBA.....BLOCK RBA OF PFXROOT
*   CTRENDRBA....DATA...BLOCKRBA+1 OF HIGHEST DATA BLOCK
*                       INITIALLY=PFXEDATA+1 BUT NOT AFTER
*                INDEX..BLOCKRBA+1 OF HIGHEST L0 BLOCK
*                       INITIALLY=PFXELVL0+1 BUT NOT AFTER
*                BECAUSE OF EMBEDDED SEGMENTS AND SPACEMAPS ANY CALCS
*                ARE MEANINGLESS
*   CTRNLOGR.....DATA, NO. OF RECORDS WRITTEN (INC. RRDS EMPTIES)
*                INDEX, NO. OF RECORDS WRITTEN FOR ALL LEVELS
*   CTRSDTASZ....DATASET SIZE AS WTO'D
***********************************************************************
