DTAIN    DCB   DSNAME=VSAMDTAI,RECFM=F,LRECL=0,MACRF=GM
*
* VSAM DTA IN/OUTFILE (FOR DATA AND AIX CREATION)
DTAINOUT DCB   DSNAME=VSAMDTAO,RECFM=F,LRECL=0,MACRF=RW
*
* VSAM IDX IN/OUTFILE (FOR INDEX CREATION AND LEVEL BUILD)
IDXINOUT DCB   DSNAME=VSAMIDXO,RECFM=F,LRECL=0,MACRF=RW
