         CLI   ITYPE,C'A'         IS CLUSTER AN AIX ?
         JE    VERRFGOK           EXIT IF IT IS
         TM    PFXRFLGS,PFX_RSPN  SPANNED ?
         JNO   VERDOUNS           EXIT IF NOT
* SPANNED
         TM    VXXXFLG1,VCLRSPAN  SPANNED IN CATALOG ?
         JO    VERRFGOK           EXIT IF IT IS
         J     VERRFGBD           EXIT
*
VERDOUNS DS    0H
