         TM    VXXXFLG1,VCLRSPAN  UNSPANNED IN CATALOG ?
         JNO   VERRFGOK           EXIT IF IT IS
VERRFGBD DS    0H
* PFXRFLGS IN ERROR
         LA    R9,1               R9=LENGTH TO DISPLAY
         LA    R4,PFXRFLGS        R4=ADDRESS OF INCORRECT VALUE
         SR    R5,R5              SHOW 'INVALID'
         JAS   R14,VERSHOW        BUILD ERROR LINE AND WTO
VERRFGOK DS    0H
         ASI   VEROFFST,1         BUMP OFFSET
